    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.synaristosai.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.synaristosai.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_synaristosai">
        <head>ΣΥΝΑΡΙΣΤΩΣΑΙ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4">
          <head>IV.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4-l1">Amorem inter deos</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4-l2">validissimum esse hoc argumento evincitur:</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4-l3">quod peierantur propter hunc omnes dei.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-1">
          <head>Ι.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-1-l1">Ἀστεῖον τὸ μή</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-1-l2">συνάγειν γυναῖκας μηδὲ δειπνίζειν ὄχλον,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-1-l3">ἀλλ᾽ οἰκοσίτους τοὺς γάμους πεποιηκέναι.</l>
          </lg>
          <pb n="203" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044098646714:scan:227" />
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Athenaeus VI p. 247 f</bibl>: καλεῖται δὲ οἰκόσιτος ὁ μὴ μισθοῦ, ἀλλὰ προῖκα τῇ πόλει ὑπηρετῶν· ἰδίως δ᾽ ἐν Συναριστώσαις ἔφη <quote>Ἀστεῖον τὸ μὴ</quote> κτλ.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Praecedit locus ex Menandri Citharista.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-2">
          <head rend="align(center)">II.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-2-l1">῎Αν ἔτι πιεῖν μοι δῷ τις· ἀλλ᾽ ἡ βάρβαρος</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-2-l2">ἅμα τῇ τραπέζῃ καὶ τὸν οἶνον ᾤχετο</l>
              <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-2-l3">ἄρασ᾽ ἀφ᾽ ἡμῶν.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Suidas</bibl>, Αἴρειν τράπεζαν ἐπὶ τοῦ παρακειμένην ἀφελεῖν τὴν τράπεζαν. Μένανδρος Κεκρυφάλῳ — καὶ Συναριστώσαις <quote>῎Αν ἔτι</quote> κτλ. Eadem <bibl>Lex. Seguer. p. 358</bibl>.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Apertum est haec ab una convivantium mulierum dicta esse. Ad convivii descriptionem spectat fragm. VIII.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-3">
          <head rend="align(center)">III.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-3-l1">Καὶ τὸν ἐπὶ κακῷ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-3-l2">γιγνόμενον ἀλλήλων ἀγαπησμόν, οἷος ἦν.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Lexicon Seguer. p. 324</bibl>: Ἀγαπησμὸν λέγουσι καὶ ἀγάπησιν τὴν φιλοφροσύνην. Συναριστώσαις Μένανδρος <quote>Καὶ τόν</quote> κτλ. Idem locus apud <bibl>Suidam s. v. ἀγαπησμός</bibl>.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4_2">
          <head rend="align(center)">IV.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4_2-l1">῎Ερως δὲ τῶν θεῶν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4_2-l2">ἰσχὺν ἔχων πλείστην ἐπὶ τούτου δείκνυται·</l>
              <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-4_2-l3">διὰ τοῦτον ἐπιορκοῦσι τοὺς ἄλλους θεούς.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Stobaeus Flor. LXIII 15</bibl>.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Versu secundo cod. B τούτοις.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-5">
          <head rend="align(center)">V.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-5-l1">Πατὴρ δ᾽ ἀπειλῶν οὐκ ἔχει μέγαν φόβον.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Stobaeus Flor. LXXIII 7</bibl>.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-6">
          <head rend="align(center)">VI.</head>
          <quote>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-6-l1">Τρισάθλιόν γε καὶ ταλαίπωρον φύσει</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-6-l2">πολλῶν τε μεστόν ἐστι τὸ ζῆν φροντίδων.</l>
            </lg>
          </quote>
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Stobaeus Flor. XCVIII 53</bibl>. Habet etiam <bibl>Antonius Mel. CLV p. 247</bibl>.</note>
        </div>
        <pb n="204" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044098646714:scan:228" />
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7_8" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-7_8">
          <head>VII. VIII.</head>
          <note type="source">
            <bibl>Pollux X 18:</bibl>
            <quote>γυναικείαν ἀγοράν, τὸν τόπον οὗ τὰ σκεύη καὶ τὰ τοιαῦτα πιπράσκουσιν — εὕροις ἂν ἐν ταῖς Συναριστώσαις Μενάνδρου.</quote> — <bibl>Plinius H. N. XXIII 15:</bibl>
            <quote rend="italic">myrtus sativa candida —- odorem oris commendat vel pridie commanducata. item apud Menandrum Synaristosae hoc edunt.</quote>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">Titulum fabulae attigit Pollux VI 101. Caecilii Synaristosae ex Menandrea fabula expressae passim laudantur.</note>
        </div>
        <pb n="773" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044098646714:scan:799" />
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-5_2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-5_2-l1">Terrorem haud magnum incutiunt genitoris minae.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-6_2">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-6_2-l1">Res per se infelix atque aerumnis obsita</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-synaristosai-6_2-l2">vita est humana, et densa curarum seges.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
